{% style %}
  /* font-display strategy (ujg6.7 update 2026-05-18):
     - BasisGrotesquePro-Regular (body text) stays `swap` + gets Arial-matched
       line-box metric overrides (ascent/descent/line-gap) so the swap doesn't
       reflow line-heights. Glyph widths intact (no size-adjust) to avoid
       horizontal regression — accepts small width-shift on swap as the
       ticket explicitly allows ("hairline-shifted body text is acceptable").
     - BasisGrotesquePro-Bold/Medium/Black/Mono-Regular flipped to `optional`
       — short-burst usage (badges, labels, accent text); fallback-only render
       on slow networks is acceptable and removes their swap-CLS contribution.
     - Geosans/SelfModern/FontAwesome unchanged (out of scope per ticket).
  */
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'GeosansLight';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: swap;
    src: local('GeosansLight'), url('{{ "GeosansLight.woff" | asset_url }}') format('woff');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'GeosansLight-Oblique';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: swap;
    src: local('GeosansLight-Oblique'), url('{{ "GeosansLight-Oblique.woff" | asset_url }}') format('woff');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'SelfModern';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: swap;
    src: local('SelfModern'), url('{{ "SelfModern.woff2" | asset_url }}') format('woff');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'SelfModernItalic';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: swap;
    src: local('SelfModernItalic'), url('{{ "SelfModernItalic.woff" | asset_url }}') format('woff');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'BasisGrotesqueProMono-Regular';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: optional; /* ujg6.7: short-burst accent usage, fallback-only on slow nets is OK */
    src: local('BasisGrotesqueProMono-Regular'), url('{{ "BasisGrotesqueProMono-Regular.woff" | asset_url }}') format('woff');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'BasisGrotesquePro-Regular';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: swap;
    /* ujg6.7: Arial-matched line-box metric overrides — eliminates vertical
       CLS at swap time. Values approximate Arial's intrinsic line-box
       metrics (units-per-em normalized): ascent 1854/2048=90.5%,
       descent 434/2048=21.2%, line-gap 67/2048=3.3%. Glyph widths
       left intact (no size-adjust) to avoid horizontal regression. */
    ascent-override: 90.5%;
    descent-override: 21.2%;
    line-gap-override: 3.3%;
    src: local('BasisGrotesquePro-Regular'), url('{{ "BasisGrotesquePro-Regular.woff" | asset_url }}') format('woff');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'BasisGrotesquePro-Bold';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: optional; /* ujg6.7: bold runs are short (buttons, headings); fallback-only OK */
    src: local('BasisGrotesquePro-Bold'), url('{{ "BasisGrotesquePro-Bold.woff" | asset_url }}') format('woff');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'BasisGrotesquePro-Black';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: optional; /* ujg6.7: black weight = badges/CTAs only */
    src: local('BasisGrotesquePro-Black'), url('{{ "BasisGrotesquePro-Black.woff" | asset_url }}') format('woff');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'BasisGrotesquePro-Medium';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: optional; /* ujg6.7: medium weight = nav/menu accent */
    src: local('BasisGrotesquePro-Medium'), url('{{ "BasisGrotesquePro-Medium.woff" | asset_url }}') format('woff');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'FontAwesome5Brands-Regular-400';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: swap;
    src: local('FontAwesome5Brands-Regular-400'), url('{{ "FontAwesome5Brands-Regular-400.woff" | asset_url }}') format('woff');
  }

  /* bd hairmnl-theme-v9o3 (2026-08-13) — metric-matched fallback for
     Questrial, the Shopify font_picker body+accent font. Questrial's own
     at-font-face is emitted by Shopify with font-display:swap, so its
     descriptors are not ours to edit; instead this companion face makes the
     PRE-swap paint occupy the same space, so the swap moves nothing.

     Why: rect attribution on the GSC-flagged sulfate article showed one
     v=0.1153 frame (75% of the page's CLS) where the header nav narrowed
     18px and article list items moved 28px, one growing by exactly a
     line-height — the fallback-to-Questrial metric handoff. Preloading the
     font was A/B'd first and does nothing (it changes when the font arrives,
     not whether the swap reflows).

     This is the same fix family as ujg6.7 at the top of this file — but
     ujg6.7 tuned BasisGrotesquePro, which appears in NO font stack (its sole
     consumer is .content-promotion-message), so the actual body font was
     never covered.

     Every number below was MEASURED in Chrome 147 on the real woff2
     (scratchpad font-metrics.mjs: canvas fontBoundingBox + DOM normal
     line-height at 100px, then a size-adjust sweep in 0.25% steps
     self-verified on realistic paragraphs):
       Questrial: ascent 82, descent 21, line-gap 0 (normal line box 103)
       Arial:     ascent 91, descent 21              (normal line box 115)
       width ratios Questrial/Arial: lowercase .9889, mixed .9899,
         digits .9900, UPPERCASE .9425
       chosen size-adjust 99.25%: paragraph-height delta 0.0px at every
       size/width combination tried (12-24px, 358-879px containers).

     KNOWN RESIDUAL, accepted deliberately: one size-adjust cannot match both
     the lowercase (.99) and uppercase (.94) ratios. 99.25% optimises body
     text, the dominant CLS term; uppercase runs (the nav is uppercase via
     the nav transform var) keep a few percent of horizontal width change at
     swap, though their line boxes are now identical.

     src is local Arial only: present on Windows and macOS, which is where
     the GSC desktop-CLS failure lives. Android has no Arial and falls
     through to the next stack entry, behaving exactly as before — Roboto
     metrics were not measured on this machine and are deliberately not
     guessed.

     css-variables.liquid inserts "Questrial Fallback" immediately after each
     Questrial token, so this face only paints during the pre-swap window;
     with Questrial cached it never renders at all. */
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Questrial Fallback';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: normal;
    src: local('Arial');
    size-adjust: 99.25%;
    ascent-override: 82%;
    descent-override: 21%;
    line-gap-override: 0%;
  }
{% endstyle %}
